<%- include('partials/header') %>

<main id="main-content" class="flex-grow pt-28 pb-20 px-6 lg:px-12 max-w-5xl mx-auto text-left">
    <!-- Header Badge -->
    <div class="mb-8">
        <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline mb-4">
            &larr; Back to Home
        </a>
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 border border-blue-500/20 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
            Financial Transparency
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-studio-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight mb-3">
            Refund & Donation Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
            Last Updated: October 20, 2026 &bull; Effective Immediately
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Transparent Pricing Promise -->
    <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-emerald-50/60 dark:bg-studio-800/80 border border-emerald-200/80 dark:border-emerald-900/30 mb-12 space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-emerald-950 dark:text-emerald-200 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span>✨</span> <span>Our Zero Hidden Fees Promise</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
            At Emmanuel United Church of Maryland Young Adults, transparency is core to our stewardship. <strong>All weekly Tuesday gatherings, bible studies, discipleship pods, and community worship nights are 100% free of charge.</strong> We never assess hidden registration surcharges, mandatory platform fees, or deceptive fees.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-10 text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
        
        <!-- 1. Free Community Events & RSVPs -->
        <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-studio-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
                1. Free Community Gatherings & Event RSVPs
            </h2>
            <p>
                Our standard events require only an RSVP so we can accommodate seating and hospitality.
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
                <li><strong>Cost:</strong> $0.00 (Completely Free).</li>
                <li><strong>Cancellation:</strong> If your plans change, you can cancel your RSVP at any time directly on our <a href="/events" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 underline">Events page</a> using your registration email. There are never cancellation penalties.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- 2. Paid Retreats & Conferences -->
        <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-studio-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
                2. Retreats, Conferences & Special Excursions
            </h2>
            <p>
                When a special overnight retreat or camp incurs external costs (such as lodging, campground rental, or catered meals), the total registration cost will always be displayed upfront with no surprise add-on fees at checkout.
            </p>
            <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-studio-800/50 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-white/10 space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-zinc-200 dark:border-white/10 pb-2">
                    <span class="font-bold text-studio-900 dark:text-white">14+ Days Before Event:</span>
                    <span class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-bold">100% Full Refund</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-zinc-200 dark:border-white/10 pb-2">
                    <span class="font-bold text-studio-900 dark:text-white">7 to 13 Days Before Event:</span>
                    <span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold">50% Partial Refund</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                    <span class="font-bold text-studio-900 dark:text-white">Less than 7 Days:</span>
                    <span class="text-zinc-500 font-semibold">Non-refundable (Catering & venue committed)</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
                <em>Special Exception:</em> In the event of a documented medical emergency, sudden illness, or bereavement, full credit or refunds will be honored upon request to leadership.
            </p>
        </section>

        <!-- 3. Charitable Giving & Tithes -->
        <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-studio-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
                3. Charitable Giving, Tithes & Offerings
            </h2>
            <p>
                Financial giving to Emmanuel United Church of Maryland is voluntary charitable giving in worship to God. Under United States Internal Revenue Code (501(c)(3)), charitable contributions are generally non-refundable once receipted.
            </p>
            <p>
                <strong>Erroneous or Duplicate Donations:</strong> If you made an unintentional error in the donation amount or experienced a duplicate transaction due to a browser glitch, please notify us within <strong>15 days</strong> of the transaction date at <a href="mailto:finance@eucmaryland.org" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 underline">finance@eucmaryland.org</a>. We will promptly investigate and issue a complete refund back to the original payment method.
            </p>
        </section>

        <!-- 4. How to Request a Refund -->
        <section class="space-y-3">
            <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-studio-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
                4. How to Request a Refund
            </h2>
            <p>
                To request a refund for a retreat or an accidental transaction:
            </p>
            <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-1 text-xs sm:text-sm">
                <li>Send an email to <a href="mailto:contact@eucmaryland.org" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 underline">contact@eucmaryland.org</a> with the subject <em>"Refund Request - [Your Name]"</em>.</li>
                <li>Include your name, email, event name/transaction date, and brief reason for the request.</li>
                <li>Our ministry team will review and respond within 2 to 3 business days. Approved refunds are credited back to your original payment method in 5 to 7 business days.</li>
            </ol>
        </section>

        <!-- 5. Organization Details -->
        <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-zinc-200 dark:border-white/10 pt-8">
            <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-studio-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
                5. Organization & Financial Office
            </h2>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm">
                <strong>Emmanuel United Church of Maryland, Inc.</strong><br>
                914 Silver Spring Ave, Silver Spring, MD 20910<br>
                Email: <a href="mailto:contact@eucmaryland.org" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 underline">contact@eucmaryland.org</a><br>
                Phone: (301) 588-4422
            </p>
        </section>
    </div>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
